rt who are  digital natives they want some sort of  status symbol in the digital realm now  with that said there are two key things  that i do think are quite misleading  about this industry one where it gets  built does not matter what i mean by  that is there are a ton of different  smart contract platforms and everyone is  in some way saying oh this is going to  be the winner we've seen things like  ethereum but we've also seen things like  flow which are nft specific blockchains  everyone is trying to figure out where  it's going to be built i personally  don't think that anyone actually cares  who's on the buyer end of these  transactions where it's being built that  leads me to my second point the reason  why they don't care is because  decentralization does not matter for the  most part in these systems what do i  mean by that i mean that when you look  at who is actually selling any sort of  scarce good in the legacy world they're  all centralized  hierarchical structures so everyone from  gucci to supreme to the nba etc they're  all centralized entities with  hierarchical structures decentralization  doesn't matter and in fact in some cases  decentralization would actually be more  difficult to execute those business  plans and those product sales when we  move to the digital realm  decentralization for the most part does  not matter it does not matter that  nobody is able to steal your system off  of a blockchain it does not matter that  nobody is able to  create more nfts a perfect example board  ape yacht club ten thousand of these  things they then created a mutant  version which is another ten thousand  does that dilute the originals or does  that simply create a whole new franchise  if you are a new intellectual property  people are debating i don't have an  answer but it's interesting to see and  so when you start to understand that  decentralization might not matter nearly  as much as people would have thought it  was it would and two that the end buyer  doesn't actually care what blockchain  these things are actually built on what  you find is that ultimately people  simply want three things they want  intellectual property that they think is  valuable regardless of whether i my  brothers or anybody else thinks it's  valuable or not ultimately just like art  value is derived by the people in the  transaction if one person believes that  they can sell something to another  person who believes that it has value  therefore that is a free market  determining value that is not for anyone  else to judge you simply can make a  decision as well from an investment  standpoint if you think that something  has value and you want to buy it and you  think it will appreciate over a long  period of time that is your right to do  it also you are making an investment  decision when somebody goes to sell  something that you think does not have  value and you choose not to buy it that  is the free market going through and  getting the perspective of multiple  players so ultimately when you have  decentralization not mattering as much  and people not caring about the  underlying blockchain what you get is  you get a recreation of the legacy  system in this digital world i actually  think that's fantastic as we see through  things like openc and others what you  start to understand is that we are  watching digital scarcity which is now  possible in the digital world you can  prove that there is actual digital  scarcity by having this public ledger  where you can actually see what the  assets are who has handled them and you  can actually check any sort of  authenticity serial numbers etc and then  you can say to yourself do i find this  valuable there's obviously billions and  billions of dollars of sales some people  will argue that that is ultimately going  to be bad investment decisions others  will argue that crypto punks will be  worth 10 20 50 100 million dollars in  the future i don't know but ultimately i  do know that the market is going to  decide and so it's worth paying  attention to but as in most markets  regardless of if you think crypto punks  board ape yacht club nba top shot or  name your favorite nft project is going  to end up being successful or not the  people who end up making a ton of money  through these boom cycles are the  infrastructure and openc is doing a  great job of that what's up guys bang  bang a bunch of you want to bring that  trillionaire energy every day and if you  want to do it in your financial life go  use sofi so fi is our exclusive sponsor  because we think they've got a great  piece of software that'll help you  accomplish your financial dreams go to  sofi.com today to get started you can  invest in everything from etfs to  individual stocks to cryptocurrencies to  ipos and they even have an automated and  best function head on over to sofi.com  today and make sure you come back  tomorrow to watch more of the best  business show  [Music]
 

